<!doctype html>
<html>
<body>
<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
<h1 style="color: #2E7D32;">Your Proof of Green Certificate Is Ready</h1>
<p>Dear {{name}},</p>
<p>Congratulations! Your Proof of Green certificate for <strong>{{month}}/{{year}}</strong> has been generated.</p>
<p><strong>Certificate ID:</strong> {{certificateId}}</p>
<p><strong>Energy Generated:</strong> {{energyGeneratedKwh}} kWh</p>
<p>You can verify your certificate anytime using this link:</p>
<p><a href="{{verifyUrl}}">{{verifyUrl}}</a></p>
<p>Log in to your WattsUp Energy account to download the PDF certificate from your Certificates dashboard.</p>
<p>Thank you for contributing to clean energy generation!</p>
<p>Best regards,<br>WattsUp Energy Team</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
